      ╭ D E T A I L ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
      │  Keep Awake  [built-in]                                          │
      │  Keep your computer awake for a set time or until you stop it. By│
      │  default it also nudges the cursor once you go idle, so chat apps│
      │  don't mark you Away. Start a session, come back later and run   │
      │  Stop. CLI only.                                                 │
      │                                                                  │
      │  PARAMETERS                                                      │
      │                                                                  │
      │  > Action   < Start a session >                                  │
      │      Start a new session, stop the running one, or check what's  │
      │      currently active.                                           │
      │                                                                  │
